OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters' transatlantic bond
OL,4,Aforged by 9/11
OL,5,
OL,6,FA transatlantic friendship between two
OL,7,Ffirefighters forged after the 9/11
OL,8,Fattacks is still going strong 25 years
OL,9,Flater.
OL,11,FPaul Smith from Northfield Fire Station
OL,12,Fin Birmingham first met Andy Horan, who
OL,13,Fworks for the Fire Department of the
OL,14,FCity of New York (FDNY), after West
OL,15,FMidlands crews raised money for their
OL,16,Fcolleagues abroad.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
