OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters' transatlantic bond
OL,4,Aforged by 9/11
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn 11 September 2001, Horan was
OL,7,Foff-duty when he saw the attacks on the
OL,8,FWorld Trade Center unfold on television
OL,9,Fbut headed straight out to help, while
OL,10,FSmith watched on horrified from
OL,11,Fthousands of miles away.
OL,13,FThe pair became firm friends when Horan
OL,14,Fvisited Birmingham to see the
OL,15,Fcharitable response. "From a really
OL,16,Fdark day, something positive came
OL,17,Fthrough," Smith said.
